@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### GET semua pelajaran
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons

### GET satu pelajaran
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/1

### POST tambah pelajaran
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Mengenal Angka 1",
  "topic": "Angka",
  "level": "Pemula",
  "duration": 15,
  "completed": false
}

### PATCH ubah pelajaran
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/lessons/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true,
  "duration": 20
}

### DELETE hapus pelajaran
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lessons/1

### Contoh NotFoundException
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/999

### Contoh ConflictException
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Mengenal Huruf A",
  "topic": "Huruf",
  "level": "Pemula",
  "duration": 10,
  "completed": false
}
